#: ../../source/evaluation/leaderboard.md:1 daf164f4a6fa484b9b7cd13c8f79cf5a
msgid "论文基准排行榜（KDD 2027）"
msgstr "Benchmark Leaderboard (KDD 2027)"

#: ../../source/evaluation/leaderboard.md:3 06f367fadff14792bc4a93a531c4c4f9
msgid "本排行榜固定呈现 UniKT 论文（KDD 2027）在 14 个公开数据集（15 个评测设置）上 43 个模型的 5 折交叉验证基准结果。如需查看后续新增模型与持续更新成绩，请切换至[最新排行榜](live-leaderboard.md)。"
msgstr ""
"This leaderboard presents the frozen five-fold cross-validation "
"results of 43 models across 14 public dataset families (15 settings) from "
"the UniKT paper (KDD 2027). For newly added models and ongoing updates, "
"see the [Live Leaderboard](live-leaderboard.md)."

#: ../../source/evaluation/leaderboard.md:6 0de4016071cd4614b4154c08d0b56107
msgid "**筛选与检索**：可通过顶部标签切换不同数据集，在输入框中输入模型名称实时检索。"
msgstr ""
"**Filter & Search**: Switch datasets using the top tabs or search in real"
" time by typing a model name into the input field."

#: ../../source/evaluation/leaderboard.md:8 ce14cbc3e1bc400286bbd092ef4d5219
msgid "**评测规范**：详细的数据集划分、早停策略与指标对齐原则请参考[评测协议与指标](protocol.md)。"
msgstr ""
"**Evaluation Specifications**: Refer to [Evaluation Protocol & "
"Metrics](protocol.md) for details on dataset splitting, early stopping "
"strategies, and metric alignment principles."

#: ../../source/evaluation/leaderboard.md:25 416e99c8f173493aadba0514c39f8320
msgid "评测规范概述"
msgstr "Overview of Evaluation Specifications"

#: ../../source/evaluation/leaderboard.md:27 7214519bb84a453aace43c5b692671c9
msgid "为保证跨模型与跨交互粒度的统一对比，基准实验遵循以下评测设置："
msgstr ""
"For consistent comparisons across models and interaction granularities, "
"all benchmark experiments follow unified settings:"

#: ../../source/evaluation/leaderboard.md:28
msgid "**数据划分**：按学生级无泄露切分固定测试集（20%）与训练池（80%），在训练池上执行 5 折交叉验证，汇报 5 折均值与标准差。"
msgstr ""
"**Data Partitioning**: Partitions students into a fixed test set (20%) and "
"a training pool (80%) subjected to five-fold cross-validation, reporting "
"mean and standard deviation over five folds."

#: ../../source/evaluation/leaderboard.md:29
msgid "**早停策略**：监控验证集 AUC，容忍轮数设为 `patience = 10`，测试阶段自动加载验证集 AUC 最优的模型检查点进行评估。"
msgstr ""
"**Early Stopping**: Terminates training after 10 consecutive validation "
"epochs without AUC improvement (`patience = 10`) and loads the "
"checkpoint with the best validation AUC for test evaluation."

#: ../../source/evaluation/leaderboard.md:30
msgid "**预测目标**：给定历史交互序列预测下一步题目作答正确概率（下一题因果预测）。"
msgstr ""
"**Prediction Objective**: Estimates the probability of a correct response "
"to the next question conditioned on observed interaction history (causal "
"next-question prediction)."

#: ../../source/evaluation/leaderboard.md:31
msgid "**交互粒度与评估协议**：榜单测试指标均在题目级（Q-level）预测上计算二分类 AUC 与 ACC（阈值 0.5）；知识组件级（KC-level）模型在测试阶段采用 all-in-one 协议将单题关联知识组件（KC）的预测概率取算术均值后再评估，以消除题内标签泄露。"
msgstr ""
"**Interaction Granularities & Evaluation Protocol**: Leaderboard test "
"metrics compute binary AUC and ACC (threshold 0.5) on Q-level predictions "
"for both granularities; during testing, KC-level models average "
"predictions across the target question's KCs via the all-in-one protocol "
"to prevent within-question label leakage."

#: ../../source/evaluation/leaderboard.md:32
msgid "**数据集设置与学生级子采样**：11 个数据集在统一预处理后的全量保留学生上评测；`EdNet-KT1`（5,000 名学生）、`Junyi15`（5,000 名学生）与 `XES3G5M`（2,500 名学生）在切分前执行学生级随机子采样（复现时在 `data_process.py process` 预处理阶段指定 `--data.sample_size`）；`ASSISTments 2017` 同时提供题目级重构 `A17PQ` 与原始步级记录 `A17` 两种预处理设置；`ABKT` 因需模型专用协议单独标注，不纳入共享协议直接排名。"
msgstr ""
"**Dataset Settings & Student-level Subsampling**: 11 datasets are "
"evaluated on all learners retained after unified preprocessing; "
"`EdNet-KT1` (5,000 students), `Junyi15` (5,000 students), and `XES3G5M` "
"(2,500 students) apply random student-level subsampling prior to splitting "
"(reproduce via `data_process.py process --data.sample_size`); "
"`ASSISTments 2017` is reported under two preprocessing settings: "
"question-level reconstruction `A17PQ` and original step-level records "
"`A17`; `ABKT` requires a model-specific protocol and is excluded from "
"shared-protocol rankings."
